/-!
# The opposite long-root pair and three point-local generators

The first hyperbolic-plane embedding identifies the literal pair with SL₂.
In characteristic two, the upper root and any nonidentity lower-root element
generate that pair. Over a field of order larger than two, its conjugates
under 1, x₄(1), and x₆(1) generate Sp₄, with all three conjugators in the
point local. Simultaneous conjugation preserves these exact identifications.

Source: Aschbacher--Smith, 11.5.7, printed p.783.
-/
